.
.  Create a GIF file for a normal ppcc plot
.
DEVICE 1 OFF
DEVICE 2 POSTSCRIPT
.
SKIP 25
READ GEAR.DAT Y X
.
TITLE AUTOMATIC
TITLE SIZE 3
LABEL CASE ASIS
Y1LABEL Normal PPCC
X1LABEL Group ID
LABEL SIZE 3
TIC LABEL SIZE 3
LINE BLANK DASH
CHARACTER X BLANK
XLIMITS 0 15
.
PRE-ERASE OFF
NORMAL PPCC PLOT Y X
.
QUIT
